y source boundary\n\nBased on [SelfBody × S50 Draft #646](https://github.com/rinsakamo/relay-self/pull/646), **no edits** to S49, `normal_action`, S16, SelfBody core, Paper producer, Action issuer, L0/L1/L2 or main. New isolated `dev/selfbody-s50-original-closure-20261031` adds `SelfBodyS50ClosedOwnerLease` and `observe_original_s49_selfbody_closure`, using **the existing S49 `observe_closed_native_actions` callback** emitted after ActionSupervisor terminal. That original `NormalActionClosedReadback` contains typed `WorldConsequence`, typed S16 `ActionOutcomeInterpretation` and exact native before/after probes. The existing SelfBody owner `project_body_action_readback(consequence, outcome)` validates them and creates the action-correlated typed BodyObservation with native provenance, then the *existing* `compose_self_body_view` validates S16 linkage. No fake Present from archived logs. One closure/one S50 source only; duplicates or missing/unknown outcomes revoke. The S50 source can be attached later via the preexisting consumer companion. Bounded, read-only, no new native probe, packet writes, model calls, learning or action grant. \n\n**Test ceiling:** offline synthetic-but-original-typed closure fixtures and existing SelfBody regression; new live World 0. The actual S49/L23 one-Action host must opt in around its existing execution context and then deliver S50 independently source-qualified data. S49 stage-R has its own single callback slot; not multiplexed in this change. No full tick/effective clear/Goal/P1/L10/QUAL/SCIENCE claims.\n\nDraft only; no merge and no original source mutation.","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-31T09:49:22Z","updated_at":"2026-10-31T10:50:11Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"3c4698c51235879d4d2d1fcdf8ff8f3de1d42f99","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"rinsakamo:dev/selfbody-s50-original-closure-20261031","ref":"de